IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-types`
IMPORT `eia-supply`
IMPORT `eia-disputes`
IMPORT `eia-enforcement`

-- Electricity Industry Act 2010 — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.
--
--   "For a distributor and a place, and a Code breach: must supply continue,
--    is it suspended, has the offence been committed, must the distributor be
--    in the dispute resolution scheme, may the Authority still act on the
--    breach, and what is the most penalty?"

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Distributor position` HAS
    `supply obligation continues`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `supply obligation suspended`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `supply offence committed`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `must be in the dispute resolution scheme`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Authority may act on the breach`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `most pecuniary penalty for the breach`             IS A NUMBER

@ref ss 52, 54, 96, 105-106
@export default A distributor's position under the Electricity Industry Act 2010 (NZ): whether its obligation to supply a place continues or is suspended, and whether it has committed the s 105(4) offence (ss 105-106); whether it must be a member of the dispute resolution scheme (s 96); and, for a Code breach, whether the Authority may still act (s 52) and the most pecuniary penalty (s 54(1)(d)). DRAFT, not reviewed by a New Zealand lawyer.
GIVEN s IS A `Supply facts`  @desc The supply obligation facts for the place
      m IS A `Scheme facts`  @desc The scheme membership facts
      b IS A `Code breach`  @desc The Code breach facts
GIVETH A `Distributor position`
`the distributor position for` s `, scheme` m `, breach` b MEANS
    `Distributor position` WITH
        `supply obligation continues`               IS `the supply obligation continues` s
        `supply obligation suspended`               IS (`the supply obligation continues` s) AND `the supply obligation is suspended` s
        `supply offence committed`                  IS `the distributor commits the s 105(4) offence` s
        `must be in the dispute resolution scheme`  IS `must be a member of the dispute resolution scheme` m
        `the Authority may act on the breach`       IS `the Authority may act on the breach` b
        `most pecuniary penalty for the breach`     IS `the most pecuniary penalty for the Code breach` b
